{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"d3d886237f184dbff3c3bd66651569e4d1dc65828799bae8e7f0cb3d0d2de58c","ja":"意外な対応","zh":"出人意料的应对","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"4c5ab028bff6c553004a1ec1071e805129a4cd44dc917fbcf56f2546b459768a","ja":"後日。劇場からの帰り道で、\n恵美もスカウトマンに捕まってしまって……","zh":"后来，在从剧场回去的路上，\n惠美也被星探拦住了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"d442f9886401a99d27570ecbe786b527132ce45d4e11af72da1b28b8a088f168","ja":"「頼むよ～。あとひとりスカウトできないと、\nオレ、上の人に怒られちゃうんだよ～」","zh":"「拜托啦～要是再招不到一个人，\n我会被上面的人骂的～」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"eb32b52f257340e2c32da1ab525bb2902f00d72e18c04a468a276be72a772ebb","ja":"え～、それは大変だね～。\nでもその、アタシは別の事務所に所属してて……。","zh":"诶～，那可太糟糕了～。\n不过那个，我属于另一家事务所……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"ad51dc1c299918bc20ac05c9f127df980b07b3363f6b33028e8db60487e43887","ja":"「そこをなんとか！　うちのほうに移籍とか！\n最悪、一瞬かけもち～とかでもいいから！」","zh":"「拜托想想办法！转到我们这边来什么的！\n实在不行，哪怕暂时兼任一下也可以！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"86d432afff6a419d40cc5a79a10cac52221aca65b96e06a55f81ad2e1aa7495c","ja":"ええっ！？　いやいや、それは無理だって！\nうう、でも断ったらこの人が困っちゃうかも……。","zh":"诶！？不不，那不可能啦！\n呜，可是要是拒绝的话，这个人可能会很为难……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"c0f67752ea0e02592241b1e5a4eb43912d38aad2d59c55bb9aa4bff99a904ce3","ja":"こらーっ！　うちのアイドルちゃんを引き抜こうとは、\nどういうことですかーっ！！","zh":"喂——！居然想挖走我们家的偶像，\n你这是想干什么啊——！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"e30a7444ded7a2801d1c35eebb30c8acc366a94f0d925be4db47cddffd5cdfe2","ja":"彼女も言っていましたが、\n私たち、すでに別の事務所に所属していますので！","zh":"她也说过，\n我们已经属于另一家事务所了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"94c91fd55e6fcc69e0de7ac0c6b5147e3b14d312d996dda030e04bf18a1bc486","ja":"勝手な契約の変更とか、二重契約とか、\nそういうことしちゃダメなんですよ～。","zh":"擅自变更合同、签订双重合同之类的事、\n这种事绝对不行哦～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"b8832e67c5fb6f38ecb79c1e55b2e70365b312186067ab75922177e500d7890b","ja":"恵美が優しいからってつけこもうとするなんて……。\nいい加減にしな！","zh":"竟然想趁惠美好心占她便宜……。\n别再闹了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"0cdb63d454f0483a90a2e815c256490b17c7c6e4c7f632c8773f7963bcccb981","ja":"「す、すみませんでしたー！」","zh":"对、对不起～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"3501d468705ade3465b71fab863c165210ddaea867e5d6ae877f4f576797e96f","ja":"うう……ごめんね、みんな。あと、ありがと。\n駆けつけてくれて助かったよ～。","zh":"呜呜……对不起，大家。还有，谢谢。\n多亏你们赶过来，我才得救了～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"61ee920818921c20845961a6c49e32a971e854e244b6e4eb761c878d38932306","ja":"お安い御用です！　でも、恵美ちゃんがスカウトを\n断り切れなかったのは、ちょっと意外でした。","zh":"小事一桩！不过，惠美没能彻底拒绝星探\n还是有点意外。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"95cb85a145d0e6dbbf57e61e972675115ccdb8d8909147ea39fc14b75169e4db","ja":"お友達の時は、\n追い払ったと言っていたので。","zh":"因为你说，面对朋友时，  \n直接把对方赶走了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"7baf5cdfbc12023ff1ea9f1fa0841d845f144ac21624e73cc6e04659693a6fa6","ja":"う～ん……友達の時は、嫌がってたし困ってたから、\nビシッと言えたんだけど……。","zh":"嗯……朋友那次，因为她不愿意又很为难，\n所以我还能干脆地说出口，可是……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"90f68db04bd78cc427b565b5e002d5a7d41a70553a8d2a0ba5a89d90151327a6","ja":"アタシのことだとつい、この人も困ってるのかもって\n思って、そしたらなんか断りにくくなっちゃって。","zh":"可一想到是我的事，就觉得\n对方可能也很为难，结果就有点难以拒绝了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"eac4d377a1bbf4dcd8c052908c88ab07effb4d46485458f5c14c21e080df24f7","ja":"ふふ。恵美ちゃんは優しいのね。","zh":"呵呵，惠美很温柔呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"fae920ddfd344e0f54858f3dff20f44ca001af38d2cfe02c72a85812684b6155","ja":"たしかに、人を思いやって強く出れない恵美ちゃんの\n優しさは、とってもとーっても素晴らしいです！","zh":"确实，替别人着想、不忍强硬起来的惠美\n她的温柔真的是非常非常了不起！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"afdf6ea024b4d720c38dba3de334a075fe46e08d6c41a33ae9f5473bdad429b2","ja":"ですがっ、ビシッと言うことも大切です！\n今後のためにも今、練習しておきましょう！","zh":"不过，果断地说出来也很重要！\n为了今后，现在先练习一下吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"d75b2e4dbb8c7217761a234127243559a711d104007c6beac7059d9112732048","ja":"れ、練習？　ここで！？","zh":"练、练习？在这里！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"6427dae6670d90677b29670b5ddd4dd99e44bf66f4f0fc60777d7e2eb6930471","ja":"はいっ！　さあ、ありさをスカウトマンだと思って、\nビシっと撃退してください！","zh":"好的！来，把亚利沙当作星探，\n请斩钉截铁地把我赶走！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"042aaa600e67b5c1c9dc0ca128037f94239dea30804c953606f9416993840460","ja":"う、うん。それじゃあ、いくよ……？\n……興味ないから、どこかへ行って！","zh":"呜、嗯。那我就开始了……？……\n我没兴趣，请你到别处去！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"d5842e6ea6dce0a80797b26cf30d20f2d221c87fcc507d1385b8ad2bbdc389ea","ja":"はうっ！　強烈な一言ですが、恵美ちゃんの\n新たな一面が見れて……ありさ、感激ですぅ！！","zh":"呜哇！这句话真够犀利，不过能看到惠美的新一面……\n亚利沙好感动啊！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"ca20af13754593d38a77094068c3431132e4bfd6a0f3e0c822167477cd61f966","ja":"もう、亜利紗が相手じゃ、\n正解か不正解かわかんないよ～！","zh":"真是的，对手是亚利沙的话，\n根本分不清是对是错啦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
